1
00:00:00,395 --> 00:00:04,315
Sheldon, I do hope you forgive me
for my inappropriate behavior last night.

2
00:00:04,525 --> 00:00:05,655
(Sheldon:)I don't blame you.

3
00:00:05,818 --> 00:00:08,148
(Sheldon:)-You were intoxicated.
-Thank you.

4
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:09,740
(Sheldon:)I blame Penny.

5
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:14,330
(Penny:)I blame Penny too. Bad Penny.

6
00:00:14,827 --> 00:00:18,457
(Leonard:)Wait a minute, what are you talking
about? What inappropriate behavior?

7
00:00:19,581 --> 00:00:21,751
(Beverley:)-I think it's best that you not know.
-Agreed.

8
00:00:21,917 --> 00:00:23,457
(Sheldon:)Agreed.

9
00:00:24,670 --> 00:00:27,170
(Leonard:)What the hell, agreed.

10
00:00:27,339 --> 00:00:30,629
(Beverley:)And I want you to take very good care
of this young woman.

11
00:00:31,176 --> 00:00:34,346
-Aw. Thank you, Beverly.
-You're welcome.

12
00:00:34,513 --> 00:00:37,303
(Beverley:)She doesn't have much
in the way of career prospects.

13
00:00:37,474 --> 00:00:40,354
(Beverley:)Don't make her responsible
for her own orgasms as well.

14
00:00:43,689 --> 00:00:47,189
(Leonard:)Remember when I was complaining that
you don't communicate with me enough?

15
00:00:47,359 --> 00:00:50,199
(Beverley:)-Yes, dear.
-I'm over it.

16
00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:55,660
Fa-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la.

